## 4. Poll sentinel / data-wf-layout-grid marker — verified live, PASS

Confirmed the grid wrapper carries `data-wf-layout-grid` and the
`#whatif-poll` sentinel is its direct child (`H`). Route-intercepted
`GET /whatif/poll**` to return a 500 continuously and waited through two
real 2s poll cycles: grid child count unchanged (3 before/after), no
`[data-wf-inline-error]` anywhere in the grid or as a direct `<body>`
child — the poll never gets an inline error injected, so it can't
re-announce identical text every 2s (checker brief's page-load-silence /
non-reannouncement concern, and ACCESSIBILITY.md point 16).

